    {
      "id": "p0001-b0008",
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        296.4700012207031,
        286.83001708984375,
        351.80999755859375
      ],
      "text": "Scientific reading moves between ideas and evidence. A reader may follow an argument, examine Fig. 1, and then return to the same paragraph. Repeatedly searching through a fixed page layout interrupts this process.",
      "font_size": 10.0,
      "bold": false,
      "styles": [
        {
          "text": "Scientific reading moves between ideas and evidence. A",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        },
        {
          "text": "reader may follow an argument, examine Fig. 1, and then",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        },
        {
          "text": "return to the same paragraph. Repeatedly searching through",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        },
        {
          "text": "a fixed page layout interrupts this process.",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        }
      ],
      "ocr": false,
      "parent_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p0001-b0009",
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        365.4700012207031,
        288.2300109863281,
        420.80999755859375
      ],
      "text": "A structured paper keeps the original text, its translation, and its source coordinates together. The translation can be changed independently, while the original evidence remains available for inspection.",
      "font_size": 10.0,
      "bold": false,
      "styles": [
        {
          "text": "A structured paper keeps the original text, its translation,",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        },
        {
          "text": "and its source coordinates together. The translation can be",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        },
        {
          "text": "changed independently, while the original evidence remains",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        },
        {
          "text": "available for inspection.",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        }
      ],
      "ocr": false,
      "parent_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p0001-b0010",
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        323.0,
        296.4700012207031,
        553.7700805664062,
        351.80999755859375
      ],
      "text": "The reading order is determined from both geometry and semantic structure. Full-width material interrupts column flow; captions, equations, and reference entries need their own roles rather than being mixed into body paragraphs.",
      "font_size": 10.0,
      "bold": false,
      "styles": [
        {
          "text": "The reading order is determined from both geometry and",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        },
        {
          "text": "semantic structure. Full-width material interrupts column",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        },
        {
          "text": "flow; captions, equations, and reference entries need their",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        },
        {
          "text": "own roles rather than being mixed into body paragraphs.",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        }
      ],
      "ocr": false,
      "parent_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p0001-b0011",
      "page": 1,
      "bbox": [
        323.0,
        365.4700012207031,
        555.7601318359375,
        420.80999755859375
      ],
      "text": "This example contains illustrative values only. Its purpose is to demonstrate interaction, not to report an experiment. All translations are supplied with the example so that the reader can be explored without an API key.",
      "font_size": 10.0,
      "bold": false,
      "styles": [
        {
          "text": "This example contains illustrative values only. Its purpose",
