        508.4700012207031,
        281.010009765625,
        563.8099975585938
      ],
      "text": "Different publishers use different layouts. An independent verification agent checks the first model's structure and translation decisions, and the preparation service repairs failed paragraphs through an ordered fallback chain.",
      "font_size": 10.0,
      "bold": false,
      "styles": [
        {
          "text": "Different publishers use different layouts. An independent",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        },
        {
          "text": "verification agent checks the first model's structure and",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        },
        {
          "text": "translation decisions, and the preparation service repairs",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        },
        {
          "text": "failed paragraphs through an ordered fallback chain.",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        }
      ],
      "ocr": false,
      "parent_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p0002-b0017",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        577.469970703125,
        287.6600341796875,
        632.8099975585938
      ],
      "text": "The separation of preparation and reading makes automated verification practical. A PC has the tools and processing time needed to reconstruct a paper. A phone needs only the resulting package and a calm interface for reading it.",
      "font_size": 10.0,
      "bold": false,
      "styles": [
        {
          "text": "The separation of preparation and reading makes automated",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        },
        {
          "text": "verification practical. A PC has the tools and processing",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        },
        {
          "text": "time needed to reconstruct a paper. A phone needs only the",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        },
        {
          "text": "resulting package and a calm interface for reading it.",
          "font": "Times-Roman",
          "size": 10.0,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "superscript": false
        }
      ],
